I called DEC about this problem a while back.  I had been hoping 
the problem would go away in V1.3 but it didn't.

There is a sort of a workaround but this also exposed some more
bugs.  Use the DXterm Options/Keyboard editor to reset the '</,'
maping.  However when you save these options, most of the other
settings from the other options menus will not appear in the
resulting DXterm file.  What I have done is capture the output
of several saves and merge them together.  (Don't save the
options again!)  I have also told dec about this problem.
The engineer that I talked to expressed some supprise that
there were two ways to control keyboard maping and he agreed
that the use of the DXterm editor was redundant.

